   "section_y": 112.9,
   "indent": 2,
   "parent": "p21-rb1-e02",
   "text": "Paracetamol 500mg-1g 4-6 hourly (up to 4g in 24 hours) as needed and/or ibuprofen2 400mg 8 hourly with/after food as needed. If severe pain, also give tramadol 50-100mg 4-6 hourly (maximum of 400mg daily).",
