   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• Doctor to check full blood count, creatinine (eGFR), urea, sodium, calcium and review results. • If focal seizures or new seizures after meningitis, stroke or head injury, discuss with specialist. • If patient had ≥ 2 definite seizures with no identifiable cause, doctor to consider epilepsy and give routine care 167.",
